// Chief Marlow's second role, unlocked once the "Clear the Deck" bounty is
// paid: he can join the party (member id 3). The role itself is quest-gated on
// the NPC definition, so this conversation only ever plays after the bounty.

title: entry
---
<<if party_has_room()>>
    <<jump offer>>
<<else>>
    <<jump full>>
<<endif>>
===

title: full
---
$npc: Looks like you're already running a full crew. Come find me if a spot opens up.
===

title: offer
---
$npc: Hey! You look like you're headed somewhere more interesting than this dock. Can I join up with you?
-> Yes
    <<recruit 3>>
    $npc: You won't regret it. Lead the way, boss!
-> No
    $npc: Suit yourself. I'll be right here if you change your mind.
===
